From: SM-G955N Ubuntu port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] libdroid: make optional systemd unit-directory metadata optional

The following if(systemd.found()) already guards unit-file generation. The
required-by-default dependency made this conditional ineffective. Private
C-library-only staging does not install or run the HAL service executables.

--- a/hals/meson.build
+++ b/hals/meson.build
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@
 )
 
 
-systemd = dependency('systemd')
+systemd = dependency('systemd', required: false)
 if systemd.found()
   systemd_unit_dir = systemd.get_variable(pkgconfig: 'systemdsystemunitdir')
 
